## Resources.cpp/make_mip_levels
B8G8R8A8, which the CPU makes no levels of: left as it was -> | level 1: ee ee ee ee
R8 3x3, 0..8 -> | level 1: 0f
R8G8 5x1 -> | level 1: 01 ff 03 fd | level 2: 02 fe
RGBA8 2x2, all transparent, red and blue -> | level 1: 80 00 80 00
RGBA8 2x2, one texel opaque red, three transparent white -> | level 1: ff 00 00 40
RGBA8 UNORM 2x2, black and white, opaque -> | level 1: 80 80 80 ff
RGBA8 sRGB 2x2, black and white, opaque -> | level 1: bc bc bc ff

